WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.824
Just another Monday morning at the company.

00:00:03.098 --> 00:00:05.533
Which van is due for a service?

00:00:06.183 --> 00:00:11.337
One look at the overview, and it's all clear: what's coming up, for every vehicle!

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:15.785
The driver snaps a photo of the garage invoice.

00:00:15.993 --> 00:00:18.122
And it's already recorded!

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:24.389
At year end: costs per vehicle, as a file for the accountant.

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:28.010
And Monday's question?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.099
It answers itself!

00:00:30.749 --> 00:00:33.423
36 francs per vehicle per year.

00:00:33.473 --> 00:00:35.982
Try it free for 30 days!
